{"book":"numbers","model":"glm-4.5","timestamp":"2026-05-03T20:18:11.888911564Z","verse":32,"ref":"numbers 4:32","tier":"bulk","chapter":4,"translation":"And ⟨the⟩ pillars of ⟨the⟩ court round about and their sockets and their pins and their ropes for all their utensils and for all their service and by name ye shall number ⟨את⟩ the utensils of ⟨the⟩ charge of their burden.","tokens":[{"surface":"ועמודי","gloss":"and the pillars"},{"surface":"החצר","gloss":"of the court"},{"surface":"סביב","gloss":"round about"},{"surface":"ואדניהם","gloss":"and their sockets"},{"surface":"ויתדתם","gloss":"and their pegs"},{"surface":"ומיתריהם","gloss":"and their ropes"},{"surface":"לכל","gloss":"for all"},{"surface":"כליהם","gloss":"their utensils"},{"surface":"ולכל","gloss":"and for all"},{"surface":"עבדתם","gloss":"their service"},{"surface":"ובשמת","gloss":"and by name"},{"surface":"תפקדו","gloss":"you shall number"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the utensils"},{"surface":"כלי","gloss":"the utensils"},{"surface":"משמרת","gloss":"of the charge"},{"surface":"משאם","gloss":"of their burden"}]}